Pewter_Text_RandomizerInfo::
  .string "I'm playing on randomizer, and I was\n"
  .string "stoked to see my {COLOR GREEN}Huge Power{COLOR RED} on my\l"
  .string "{COLOR GREEN}Slaking!{COLOR RED}\p"
  .string "But, the next day it turned into {COLOR GREEN}Slow\n"
  .string "Start.\p"
  .string "{COLOR RED}Turns out, the randomizer seed changes\n"
  .string "depending on the day of the week.\p"
  .string "So I gotta wait until next week for\n"
  .string "my broken{COLOR GREEN} Slaking{COLOR RED} to come back.$"


